    "introduction": "Dona Gregorio is an American Actress based in Los Angeles. Dona was born Donna Lisa DeGregorio and raised in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, USA to Iliana Orselli & Donald DeGregorio. The youngest of 4 girls. Dona is Italian-American decent. Her mother was raised in Naples, Italy & father was a police officer & marine from Merchanville, NJ. & Philadelphia, Pa. She is an Actress, Model, Host and has performed on Broadway & in numerous theatre productions. She studied Meisner at Playhouse West & studied at the Ivana Chubbuck studio. Improvisation & musical theatre at the Walnut Street theatre in PA. Her other passion is fitness. Dona is a certified personal trainer/health coach which landed her a recurring role as Sparkle on Broad City-Comedy Central as a personal trainer. She has appeared on season 2, 3 & 4. Jinx Jenkins in the theatre production \"The Savannah Sipping Society.\"",
